  "content": "\n\n# Эффектные анимации дверей\n\n![](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gQIpdGQl/images/554da7a7dabbceadbfab61af5ecec6b454daba7d.gif)\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/gQIpdGQl\">\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/gQIpdGQl?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth&labelColor=16181c&color=34363c\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/gQIpdGQl?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth&labelColor=ebebeb&color=88af5c\">\n  <img alt=\"Скачивания на Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/gQIpdGQl?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth&labelColor=16181c&color=34363c\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-door-animations\">\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1357699?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&labelColor=16181c&color=34363c\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1357699?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&labelColor=ebebeb&color=88af5c\">\n  <img alt=\"Скачивания на CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1357699?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&labelColor=16181c&color=34363c\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/P7dR8mSH\">\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric%20API-Required-34363c?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=16181c&logo=data%3Aimage%2Fsvg%2Bxml%3Bbase64%%2BPHBhdGggZD0iTTEyIDEydjkiIC8%2BPHBhdGggZD0iTTEyIDEybC04IC00LjUiIC8%2BPHBhdGggZD0iTTEyIDEybDggNC41IiAvPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0xMiAzdjkiIC8%2BPHBhdGggZD0iTTEyIDEybC04IDQuNSIgLz48L3N2Zz4%3D\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric%2